  "description": "College student Gyeong-A needs all the help she can get to win over her crush Hyeon. She just didn't expect that help to be brutally honest makeup tips from her doll Marina that that suddenly sprang to life. A dazzling makeover and a new sense of style is easy, but are kissable lips and a touch of blush enough to charm the boy of her dreams? Follow along as newbie Gyeong-A learns the ins and outs of cosmetics and makeup! \n\n(Source: Tappytoon, edited)",
